{
  "duration": 49.239,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 1.559,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.099,
      "end": 3.279,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.839,
      "end": 4.599,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.059,
      "end": 7.519,
      "text": "a bus travels at eighty kilometer per hour"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.059,
      "end": 8.8,
      "text": "for six hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.239,
      "end": 12.159,
      "text": "The same distance must be covered in only four point five hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.639,
      "end": 13.559,
      "text": "What do we need to find?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.059,
      "end": 15.659,
      "text": "We need to find the new speed of the bus."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 18.439,
      "text": "First, let us find the distance covered by the bus."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.1,
      "end": 21.299,
      "text": "Distance is equal to speed multiplied by time."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.779,
      "end": 24.419,
      "text": "So distance is equal to eighty multiplied by six,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.0,
      "end": 27.079,
      "text": "which gives us four hundred eighty kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.799,
      "end": 30.879,
      "text": "Now that we know the distance, we can find the required speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.459,
      "end": 33.52,
      "text": "Speed is equal to distance divided by time."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.059,
      "end": 37.879,
      "text": "So the required speed is four hundred eighty divided by four point five."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.479,
      "end": 39.279,
      "text": "After solving this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.7,
      "end": 42.979,
      "text": "we get one hundred six point six seven kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.419,
      "end": 49.239,
      "text": "Hence, the final answer is one hundred six point six seven kilometer per hour, which is option C."
    }
  ],
